 "caption": "WHO WON THE JIMMY TRADE? 🌉🔥\n\nAlmost two years later, here's the scoreboard:\n• We got: Jimmy Butler. 38 in the play-in and a Game 7 win in Houston in year one, then a torn ACL against Miami in year two (20.0 PPG in 38 games)\n• Heat got: Andrew Wiggins, Kyle Anderson and the pick that became Kasparas Jakučionis (No. 20, 2025)\n• Year one: both teams made the playoffs (we lost to Minnesota in round two, Miami got swept by Cleveland)\n• Then Jakučionis + Tyler Herro went out in the deal for Giannis Antetokounmpo\n\nAdd it up: Jimmy for Wiggins and a piece of Giannis. We're 8-8 and 6-1 at home. The Heat are 9-6.\n\nStill, we beat Miami 120-100 on Nov 5 (Wiggins had 2). Boston's at Chase Center Sunday, 8:30 PM ET. Win and we're 9-8.\n\nSo who won the Jimmy trade: Heat or Warriors? You make the call 👇\n\n#NBA #JimmyButler #Warriors #StephenCurry #BasketBall",
